<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dani</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu ashi sha Daniyeli shitakulira makaliru na malola ga mbuyi gwa Mlungu Daniyeli shaka shilii wantu wa Israeli pawaweriti wamanda Babeli. Shitakulira Daniyeli na waganja wakuyi ntambu yawaweriti waminika kwa Mlungu, viraa shijega umbuyi kuwusu wantu wa maisi gamonga na pasipanu. Shitabu ashi shitakulila mirandu yayilawiriti mu shinja sha mia sita na mhanu mpaka mia tanu selasini na tanu K.K. Shaka Daniyeli pakaweriti kankatendera falumi gwekagweka za Babeli. Wasomi wa makashu wajimira kuwera Daniyeli ndo yakalembiti shitabu ashi pakaweriti Babeli, kumbiti wasomi wa vinu walonga shitabu ashi shilembitwi shakapanu mu Israeli, mkalini ya pili pamberi pa kwiwuka Yesu. Wamonga wajimira seemu ya shitabu ashi shilembitwi mshaka sha gwekagweka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Daniyeli shilembitwi toziya ya kujega litumbiru kwa wantu wa Israeli weni walikaliti muwuhamisiwu, viraavirii kwa wiwuka yawiza yawafira kulikala shaka sha ntabiku. Mlungu kalanguziya makakala gakuyi kwa wafalumi na wantu wa isi zimonga, kupitira mirandu yoseri yayilawiriti mumakaliru ga Daniyeli na muumbiyi wa mirandu yayiza. Kwa kulola biblia, shitabu ashi shitutanga kuvimana mirandu ya ufalumi wa Mlungu mlipatanu lya syayi. Kwa mfanu Masihi katakulitwi kala mushitabu sha Daniyeli shipandi 7:13-14. Daniyeli kawoniti malola shaka sha upeleru, geni gatakulilwa na Yesu (Matayu 24:15 Mariku 13:14) Viraa galifana na gakalembiti Yohana musihitabu sha ugubutulu. Daniyeli viraa kafananaziya na umbuyi wa Yeremiya (Daniyeli 9:1-3).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagawera amu</para>
  <para style="io">Shitabu ashi shitakulira Daniyeli na waganja wakuyi walikaliti Babeli shaka sha ukolamlima, Nebukaneza shipandi sha kwanja mpaka sha msheshi.</para>
  <para style="io">Shitabu ashi kayi Daniyeli kankutakulira malola gakuyi mfalumi Balishaza shipandi sha mhanu.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu shitabu shitakulira Daniyeli mulilindi lya simba shaka sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Daliusi shipandi sha sita.</para>
  <para style="io">Viraavirii shitabu ashi shitakulira Mlungu ntambu yakampanana Daniyeli ugubutulu gwekagweka wa malawiru yagiza. Daniyeli kankugatula pamuhera malola mawili ga shaka shashiza na mana zakuyi mshipandi sha saba mpaka sha nani, viraa Daniyeli kankawaluwira wantu wakuyi na malaika Gabulieli kamwankula mshipandi sha tisa viraa Malaika Gabulieli kagubutula mirandu ya kulikangasha kwa mfanu upeleru wa pasi panu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s">Daniyeli na waganja wakuyi aku Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />Mu shinja sha tatu sha ukolamlima wa Yehoyakimu mfalumi gwa Yuda, Nebukadineza mfalumi gwa Babeli, kagenditi kuguzyengeta mji gwa Yerusalemu kwa lishonta su kugukomanga. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamleka Yehoyakini mfalumi gwa Yuda kabatwi nalishonta lya mfalumi Nebukadineza pamuhera na vyombu vimu kulawa Munumba ya Mlungu. Nayomberi kavitola vyombu mpaka kunumba nkulu ya mlungu gwakuyi aku Shinari na yomberi kavitula muluhanja lya mlungu gwakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Shakapanu mfalumi Nebukadineza kamlagalira Ashipenazi, mlonguziya mkulu gwa wantu wakuyi, kamsyaguliri wantemba wamu wa Waisraeli yawaweriti wiwuka wa shifalumi na wantu yawamanika kulawa Yuda. <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />Mfalumi kafiriti wantemba yawahera shilema, waherepa, wazowelera wa kila luhala, wana mahala na umani na yawafaa kutenda lihengu muliboma. Kafiriti viraa wantemba awa wafundwi kusoma na kulemba luga ya Wakalidayu. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Mfalumi ayu kalagaliriti wantemba awa wapananwi shiboga shiherepa sheni mweni kaliyiti na divayi yeni kalanditi. Wantemba awa wafiruwitwi wafundwi kwa vinja vitatu, shakapanu wajegwi kwa mfalumi. <verse eid="DAN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Wantemba wamu yawasyagulitwi waweriti Daniyeli, Hananiya, Mishaeli na Azaria, woseri wa likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Mkulu gwa maafisa ayu kawapanana matawu gamonga, Denieli kamshema Beliteshaza, Hananiya kamshema Shadiraki, Mishaeli kamshema Meshaki na Azaria kamshema Abedinego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Kumbiti Daniyeli kaamuwa nakatenda kalwemwi na Mlungu kwa kuliya shiboga shiherepa sha mfalumi na kulanda divayi yakuyi. Hangu, kamluwiti mlonguziya mkulu kamjimiri nakaliya vintu avi na kulitenda kalemwi na Mlungu. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Su Mlungu kamtenda Ashipenazi mlonguziya mkulu gwa watenda lihengu wa mfalumi, kampendeleyi Daniyeli na kuwoneruwa lusungu. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />“Kumbiti, mlonguziya mkulu gwa watenda lihengu wa mfalumi, kamgambira Daniyeli, nana lyoga kuwera mtuwa gwangu mfalumi mweni kalagalira kuusu shiboga na virandu vyagufiruwa kutendera, hakawoni kuwera nshimba yako iherepa ndiri gambira wantemba wa ukulu wenu. Makaliru gangu hagaweri mkutenduwa.”<verse eid="DAN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Shakapanu Daniyeli kamgendera ntumintumi yakatulitwi na mlonguziya mkulu watenda lihengu wa mfalumi, su kuwagolokera yomberi Daniyeli na wayaguyi ashina Hananiya, Mishaeli na Azariya, <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />“Shondi, gutujeri twenga wantumintumi waku kwa mashaka lirongu kwakutupanana makolu ga mihamba tuliyi na mashi ga kulanda. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Shakapanu, gutulinganiziyi twenga na wantemba wamonga yawaliya shiboga shakaliya mfalumi na gutakuli kulinganira na ntambu yaguwoniti.”<verse eid="DAN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Shakapanu Daniyeli kamgendera Arioko mgolokera ulii kajimilirana na womberi su kawajera kwa mashaka lirongu. <verse eid="DAN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Pa mashaka lilongu, pakawaloliti, kawona kuwera wantemba walii yawaliyiti makolu wawonikiti wana makakala kuliku wamonga walii woseri yawaliyiti shiboga sha shifalumi. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Su, mgolokera ulii kawaleka wendereyi kuliya makolu pa shiboga shawapananitwi na mfalumi na divayi.<verse eid="DAN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Mlungu kawapanana wantemba awa wamsheshi umani na mahala mu shiraa malembu ga usomi na luhala. Daniyeli viraa kapananitwi uwezo wa kutakulira malola na kulota. <verse eid="DAN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Pa vinja vitatu vyavilagaliritwi na mfalumi Nebukadineza kupera, mlonguziya mkulu gwa watenda lihengu gwa mfalumi kawajega wantemba woseri kulongolu kwakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Mfalumi kayoweriti na womberi, kawoniti Daniyeli, Hananiya, Mishaeli na Azaria wawonikiti wafaa nentu. Su, wingirwa mulihengu lya kumtendera wa mfalumi. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Mlandu goseri gwa luhala ama umani gweni mfalumi kawakosiyiti kaliwonera mweni handa wantemba awa wamsheshi waweri waherepa mala lilongu kuliku watukuziya, wambuyi na waganga woseri muukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Na yomberi Daniyeli kendeleyiti kutenda lihengu muukolamlima mpaka shinja sha kwanja sha kukolamlima kwakuyi mfalumi Koreshi.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Nebukadineza kalota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />Mushinja sha pili sha ukolamlima wakuyi, mfalumi Nebukadineza kalotiti, Kulota aku kumjegera lyoga mumoyu mwakuyi mpaka kasinda kugonja. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />Shakapanu, mfalumi kalagalira waganga na wambuyi na wantu yawana luhala na wahawi wa Wakalidayu, wajegwi su wamtambiri kulota kwakuyi. Woseri wiza na kugoloka kulongolu kwakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />“Mfalumi Nebukadineza kawagambira, notiti na kulota aku kunjegera lyoga, nfira kuvimana mana yakuyi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />“Womberi wamgambira mfalumi kwa luga ya Shiaramu, gulikali, gwee mfalumi! Gututambili kulota kwaku na wantumintumi waku hatukugambiri mana yakuyi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />“Mfalumi kawagambira, shisoweru sha ntakula shanakaka. Pamng'ambirandiri kulota kwangu kuweriti kwa ntambu gaa na mana yakuyi, hamuhanjangwi vipandivipandi wungu vyenu na numba zyenu hazibomolwi. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Handa pamung'ambira mana ya kulota aku, haniwapanani lifupu na ligoya likulu. Vinu, mung'ambiri mana ya kulota aku!”<verse eid="DAN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />“Womberi wamwankula kayi, mfalumi, gututambiri kulota aku na twenga wantumintumi waku hatukugambili mana yakuyi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />“Shakapanu mfalumi kawankula pakalonga, nivimana kuwera mjera kukawiziya shaka, toziya mvimana kuwera shantalukiti shanakaka, <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />Kumbiti pamung'ambirandiri kulota aku, likomangu lyenu ndo limu. Mpataniti kumpayira na kuzyangazyanga. Agawu shaka shangupita. Su, mung'ambiri kulota aku na neni hanivimani kuwera muweza kung'ambira mana yakuyi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />“Wantu yawana luhala walii wamwankula mfalumi, pawalonga. Gwee mfalumi, kwahera muntu yoseri pasipanu yakaweza kutenda shagufira. Kwahera mfalumi yoseri, ata mekaweri mkulu na kana likakala nentu mekawezi kuwakosiya waganga ama wahawi ama wantu yawana luhala mlandu handa agu. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Gwee mfalumi, mlandu yagugukosiyiti ndo gukamala nentu. Kwahera muntu yakaweza kukugambira mana yakuyi ila wamlungu gweka yakuyi weni walikalandiri muwamu mwa wantu.” <verse eid="DAN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Mfalumi Nebukadineza pakapikaniliti aga kakalaliti nentu, kalagalira wamashonta wakuyi wawalagi wanaluhala woseri wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Su, lilagaliru lipikanika kuwera wanaluha woseri walaguwi, Daniyeli na wayaguwi vira wasakulwa su walaguwi.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kamlanguziya Daniyeli mana ya kulota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Shakapanu, Daniyeli kamgenderiti Arioko kwa kulolalora, Mkulu gwa watenda lihengu wa mfalumi na mweni kapananitwi lihengu lya kuwalaga wana luhala wa Babeli, <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Daniyeli kamkosiya mgolokela mkulu gwa watenda lihengu wa mfalumi, “Ntambu gaa mfalumi kalagalira kwa ukalipa hangu? Arioko ndo kamgambira Daniyeli mlandu agu.”<verse eid="DAN 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Su Daniyeli kamgenderiti mfalumi na kumluwa kampananani shaka su kawezi kumgambiziya mfalumi mana ya kulota kwakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Shakapanu, Daniyeli kawuya ukaya, kawagambira wayaguyi Hananiya, Mishaeli na Azariya mlandu agu. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />Kawagambira wamluwi Mlungu gwa Kumpindi kawawoneri lusungu kuusu bada ayi, su womberi nawagamira pamuhera na wantu yawana luhala wamonga wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Shakapanu Daniyeli kalanguziwa kulota na mana yakuyi. Su Daniyeli kalonga mayagashi Mlungu gwa kumpindi,<verse eid="DAN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:20">Mlungu kakwiswi mashaka goseri pota upeleru.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:20">“Luhala na uwezo ndo vyakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />Kavitenda vintu vyoseri vitendeki kwa shaka shakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">kawatula wafalumi na kuwawusiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">Kawapanana luhala yawana luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">wana umani.<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />Kagubutula bada na mirandu yayilififa, kashimana shashiwera kuluwindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:22">mweni kalikala mukulangala.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />Gwee Mlungu gwa Wambuyi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">nonga mayagashii na kukuzyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">mana gumpanana luhala na likakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">gutugambiziya shilii shanikuluwiti, gutugambiziya shitwatira shilii sha mfalumi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniyeli kankumtambira kulota na mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Hangu Daniyeli kamgendera Arioko yakaweriti kalagalira kuwagamiziya wanaluhala wa Babeli, kamgambira, “Naguwalaga wantu wa luhala wa Babeli, ila gunjegi neni kulongolu kwa mfalumi na neni hanimgambiziyi mana ya kulota kwakuyi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Shakapanu, Arioko kamjega Daniyeli kulongolu kwa mfalumi kalongola na kumgambira, “Nimpata muntu tunga muwamu mwa wantu yawajegwitwi panu kulawa Yuda, yakaweza kukutakulira mana ya kulota kwaku, gwee mfalumi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Mfalumi kamkosiya Daniyeli, “Daniyeli mweni viraa kashemitwi Beliteshaza, hashi, guweza kung'ambiziya kulota kwanotiti na mana yakuyi?”<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Daniyeli kamwankula, gwee Mfalumi, “Kwahera muntu yakana luhala ama wahawi ama wambuyi ama waganga wa wakalidayu yawaweza kukugambiziya bada yaku ayi.” <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />Kumbiti kwana Mlungu kumpindi mweni kagubutula mirandu ya bada, na yomberi kakugambiziya, gwee mfalumi Nebukadineza, mirandu yayifira kulawira mashaka gagiza. Kulota kwaku na malola yagakwiziliti mumtuwi gwaku paguweriti gwankugonja ndo aga.<verse eid="DAN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />Gwee mfalumi, paguweriti gugonja pashitanda paku, gakwiziliti maholu kuusu mirandu hayilawiri shakapanu na Mlungu yakagubutula mirandu ya bada, kakulangaziya galii hagalawiri. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Kumbiti neni ng'ubutulitwindiri mlandu agu toziya nana luhala kuliku wantu wamonga, su gwenga mfalumi gupati kumaniziwa mana ya kulota kwaku na kukugambira maholu gaku.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />Gwee mfalumi, mukulota kwaku guwoniti shinyagu shikulu nentu na yashing'eleng'eta nentu, shigoloka kulongolu kwaku. Shinyagu ashi shikulu nentu shiweriti sha kutiriziya nentu. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Mtuwi gwa shinyagu ashi shikulu nentu shiweriti sha zahabu iherepa, shifuwa shakuyi na mawoku gakuyi gaweriti ga madini ga feza, mtima gwakuyi na mawondu gakuyi gaweriti ga shaba. <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />Magulu gakuyi gaweriti ga shuma na lwayu zakuyi ziweriti za mhanganiku gwa shuma na litapaka lya ukaka. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />Paguweriti gwankali gwankulola, Libuwi likulu nentu litupukiti lyeni kulawa kuligongu pota kushinkulwa na muntu, liguma na kugaposholaposhola magulu ga shaba na utapaka wa ukaka wa shinyagu shikulu nentu shilii na kushimeganga vipandivipandi. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Shakapanu shuma shilii na utapaka wa ukaka na shaba na feza na zahabu, vyoseri vipandika vipandivipandi na kuwera gambira miwawi ya pahala pa kukomera viboga shaka sha shiyangazi. Liyega vivigulusiya kutali pota kusigala ata shipandi shimu. Kumbiti libuwi lili lyalimegiti shinyagu shilii ligalambuka kuwera lugongu lukulu na kupamemiziya pasipanu poseri.<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />Gwee mfalumi ayi ndo iweriti lota yaku. Su vinu hatukugambili mana yakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Gwee mfalumi, gwenga gwa mkulu kwa wafalumi woseri! Mlungu gwa kumpindi kakupanana ufalumi, uwezu, likakala na uweru. <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />Mlungu kakutenda gukolimlima wantu woseri, vigongolu wa kuntundu na wampongu woseri wa kuliyera, koseri kulii kwawawera. Gwenga ndo mtuyi gulii gwa zahabu. <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />Pa gwenga hawizii ufalumi umonga, Kumbiti ufalumi awu hawuweri wahera makakala. Pa ufalumi awu gwapili kupela hawufatwi ufalumi wa tatu wawulifana na shaba, awu hawukolimlima wantu woseri pasipanu. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Pa falumi azi kupera, hawizi ufalumi wa msheshi ugangamala gambira shuma. Handa shuma yashimega na kupondaponda vintu vyoseri, ufalumi awu hawugalambuli yagatulitwi na falumi yazilongoleriti. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Ntambu yaguwoniti kuwera seemu za nzayu na vyala vya shinyagu shikulu nentu ashi viweriti nusu utapaka wa ukaka na nusu shuma. Ayi yana mana kuwera ufalumi awu hawubaganiki, kumbiti ufalumi awu hawuweri na makakala ga shuma na makakala madidini ga utapaka wa ukaka. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Ntambu yaguwoniti, vyala vyakuyi vya magulu viweriti nusu shuma na nusu litapaka lya ukaka na ayi imaniziya kuwera ufalumi awu hawuweri na makakala madidini na kuperuwa makakala ntambu tunga. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Ayi ilanguziya kuwera wakolamlima wa ufalumi awu hawahanganiki kwa kuyuga wantu wa isi zimonga, kumbiti hapeni wawezi kuhanganika handa shuma ntambu yashiwezandiri kuhanganywa na litapaka lya ukaka. <verse eid="DAN 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />Shaka sha wafalumi awa, Mlungu gwa kumpindi hakawutuli ufalumi ugangamala. Wantu wamonga hapeni wawukanki na kuukolamlima ufalumi awu, su ufalumi awu hawuwupondi na kunyamaziya falumi yazilongoleriti na weni hawulikali mashaka goseri. <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Guliwoniti libuwi lyalitupukiti lyeni kulawa kulugongu, pota kushinkurwa, ntambu yayishipanditi shinyagu vipandivipandi shinyagu shikulu nentu shilii shashinyawitwi kwa shuma na shaba, litapaka lya ukaka, feza na zahabu. Gwee mfalumi, Mlungu Mkulu kakugubutulira mirandu yanayilawiri shakapanu. Neni nikutambira, kulota kwaku ndo kwa nakaka na mana yakuyi ndo yeni.<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi kankumfupa Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Shakapanu mfalumi Nebukadineza pakaguwiti makukama na kumsundamalira Daniyeli na kulonga wamlavilira Daniyeli tambiku na ubani. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Mfalumi Nebukadineza kamgambira Daniyeli, “Nakaka Mlungu gwaku ndo Mkulu kuliku wamlungu woseri na Mtuwa yakakolamlima wafalumi woseri na ndo yakagubutulwa bada zoseri zazilififiti na yomberi ndo yakakutenda kutakuli bada ayi.” <verse eid="DAN 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Shakapanu mfalumi Nebukadineza kampanana Daniyeli ukulu. Nakampanana lifupu livuwa na kumtenda mkolamlima gwa mkowa goseri gwa Babeli na mkulu gwa wana luhala woseri wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Daniyeli kamluwa mfalumi kawatula Shadilaki, Meshaki na Abedinego kuwera wagolokera wa mirandu ya ukolamlima wa mkowa gwa Babuloni. Kumbiti Daniyeli kasigala muliboma lya mfalumi.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nebukadineza kalagalira wantu kuguwira shinyagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Mfalumi Nebukadineza kalagaliliti wantu wakuyi wanyawi shinyagu sha zahabu, shana utali wa mita ishilini na nani na upana mita ntatu. Kayigolosiyiti pahala palulanda lwa Dura mumkowa gwa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Shakapanu mfalumi kawagambira walongoziya wakulu, wagolokera, wakulu wa mikowa, watakula, walolera luhanja, watoza, mahakimu na maafisa woseri wa mikowa wizi mumsambu gwa kwanja kushiguwira shinyagu shakashigolosiyiti. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Shakapanu, wakulu woseri wajojonika, kulongolu kwa shinyagu ashi. <verse eid="DAN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Shakapanu mbwera kabwera kwa kubota pakalonga, “Mwenga wantu wa makabila goseri na wantu wa maisi goseri na wantu wa luga zoseri, mlagalirwa kuwera, <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />pampikanira liziwu lya lipenka, mluli na lingutinguti na lugombugombu na zezi na zumari na maziwu gamonga ga vyombu vya kwimbira, mfiruwa mng'ong'onali pasi na kushiguwira shinyagu sha zahabu yakashigolosiyiti mfalumi Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Na yoseri yakang'ong'onalandiri pasi na kushiguwira, hakasirwi mulitanuli lya motu gukalipa.” <verse eid="DAN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Su, wantu woseri, katepu pawapikiniriti maziwu ga mapenka na mluli na lingutinguti na lugombugombu na zezi na zumari na maziwu gamonga ga vyombu vya kwimbira, waguwiti makukama na kushiguwira shinyagu shilii sha zahabu sheni mfalumi Nebukadineza kashigolosiyiti.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waganja wa Daniyeli wankusitakiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Shaka ashi, wamu wa Wakalidayu wiziti na kuwashongera Wayahudi. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />Wamgambira Mfalumi Nebokadineza! “Gwee mfalumi gulikali mashaka goseri. <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Gwee mfalumi, gulagaliriti kuwera kila muntu pakapikinira liziwu lya lipenka na mluli na lingutinguti na ligombugombu na zezi na kila ntambu yimonga ya vyombu vya kwimbira, kang'ong'onali pasi na kushiguwira shinyagu shirii sha zahabu. <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />Na muntu yoseri yakang'ong'onalandiri pasi na kushiguwira shinyagu ashi, hakaswiri mulitanuli lya motu gukalipa. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Vinu, kwana Wayahudi tunga yaguwasyaguliti kugolokera mirandu ya ukolamlima wa mkowa gwa Babeli, weni ndo Shadilaki, Meshaki na Abedinego, gwee mfalumi wantu awa wajimirandiri amuli yaku. Walema kuwatendera wamlungu waku na kushiguwira shinyagu shilii sha zahabu shagushigolosiyiti.”<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Panu mfalumi Nebukadineza, agawu pakawera na maya, kahimiziya Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego wajengwi kulongolu kwaku. Na womberi wajengwa kwa mfalumi. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Mfalumi Nebukadineza kawakosiya hangu, “Gwenga Shadilaki, Meshaki na Abedinego, vinu nakaka mulema kuwatendera wamlungu wangu pota kushiguwira shinyagu shilii sha zahabu yanishigolosiyi. <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Vinu, pampikinira kayi liziwu lya lipenga na mluli na lingutinguti na lugombugombu na filimbi ntali na maziwu ga ngoma zimonga, Hashi kung'ong'onala pasi na kushiguwira shinyagu shanishinyawiti? Handa pamlema, hamwaswi ula vinu mutanuli lya motu gukalipa. Hashi, ndo mlungu gaa yakaweza kuwalopola muwuwezu waneni?”<verse eid="DAN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Shakapanu Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego wamwankula mfalumi, “Gwee Nebukadineza, twenga tufirandiri kukwankula toziya ya mlandu agu. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Payiwera hangu, Mlungu gwetu mweni yatumtendera kaweza kutulopola mulitanuli lya motu gukalipa na yomberi hakatulopoli mumakakala gaku, gwee mfalumi. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Gwee mfalumi payitendekandiri ntambu ayi, guvimani pota kufifa, handa twenga hapeni tuwatenderi wamlungu waku pota kuguwira shinyagu sha zahabu shagushigolosiyiti.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayaguyi Danieli wankutozwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Shakapanu mfalumi Nebukadineza kakalala nentu na sheni shakuyi shigalambuka kwa nkalaliru toziya ya Shadilaki, Meshaki na Abedinego. Kalagalira motu gwa tanuli gongereki mara saba kuliku ntambu yakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Kawagambira wantu tunga wana makakala nakamu mulishonta lyakuyi wawatawi Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego na kuwasira mulitanuli lilii lya motu gukalipa. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Su, wantemba awa watawalilwa pawera wavala makoti gawu na mahabiti gawu na vilemba na nguwu zawu zimonga, waswa pakatikati pa tanuli lya motu gukalipa. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Mana lagiru lya mfalumi liweriti likalipa nentu na motu gulii gwawawashiti guweriti gukalipa nentu, ata mbamba za motu ziwalagiti wantu walii yawawajegiti Shadilaki, Meshaki na Abedinego. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Shakapanu Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, pawawera watawalirwa, wasirwa mulitanuli lya motu gukalipa.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Su, mfalumi Nebukadineza kalikangasha, kagoloka kalongola na kuwakosiya wagambiziya wakuyi, “Hashi, tuwasandiri wantu watatu pamotu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:24">Na weni wamwankula mfalumi, “Yina, mfalumi! Ntambu yayiwera.”<verse eid="DAN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />“Shakapanu kakosiya, hashi vinu mona wantu wamsheshi pawatyangatyanga mumotu, pota kutawalirwa na kulungula na muntu gwa msheshi kawoneka gambira mwana gwa wamlungu.”<verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantemba wankulekeziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Su, mfalumi Nebukadineza kalisegelera ligomi lya tanuli lya motu gukalipa, kashema, “Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, wantumintumi wa Mlungu mkulu, mlawi kunja mwizi agawu! Su Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego walawa kumotu.” <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Su walongoziya wakulu na wagolokera, wakulu wa mikowa na watakuziya wa mfalumi, woseri wajojonika na kuwazyengeta, wawona kuwera motu gulii gusinda kuwalunguziya watatu awa. Mviri zawu zilungulandiri, ata nguwu zawu zilungulandiri, pota wanunkandiri motu.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Hangu, mfalumi Nebukadineza kalonga, “Kazumwi Mlungu gwa Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego toziya kawatuma wantumintumi wakuyi wa kumpindi na kuwalopola wantumintumi wakuyi weni wamtumbira. Womberi wajimiritindiri lagiru ya neni ya shifalumi, wawoniti mbaka kuhowa kuliku nawaguwira wamlungu wamonga,” Ila Mlungu gwawu gweka yakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />“Hangu, ndagalira handa wantu wa likabila lyoseri, isi yoseri ama luga yoseri, yawafirakumtakula vidoda Mlungu gwa Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, walikitulwi viwungu vyawu shimushimu na numba zawu hazibomoluwi. Mana kwahera Mlungu yumonga yakaweza kulopola ntambu ayi.”<verse eid="DAN 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Su, mfalumi Nebukadineza kawatenda waweri wakulu kwa kuwakweniziya muvyewu Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego mkowa gwa Babeli.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s">Lota ya pili ya mfalumi Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />Neni mfalumi Nebukadineza, niwalembera wantu wa makabila goseri, maisi goseri na luga zoseri pasipanu poseri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:1">Muweri na ponga nentu! <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Nananemeru kuwagambiziya kuusu langaliru ya mawuzawuza na makangashu geni Mlungu Yakawera Kumpindi Nentu kantendera.<verse eid="DAN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />Guloli ntambu yaziwera nkulu langaliru zakuyi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">Makangashu gakuyi ndo makulu nentu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">Ufalumi wakuyi ndo ufalumi wa mashaka goseri, ukulu waku ulikala wiwuka mpaka wiwuka.<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />Neni, Nebukadineza, weriti nilikala ponga ukaya kwangu na kuwera na mpatiru muliboma lyangu. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Paweriti ng'onja pashitanda shangu, sawiti ndotu yayintiliziya na maholu na malola gangu ga kumtuyi gantiliziya. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Su, ndagalira wanaluhala woseri wa Babeli wajegwi kulongolu kwa neni su wang'ambiri mana ya kulota aku. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Shakapanu waganga na wahawi Wakalidayu na walola ntondu wajegwa. Niwatambira kulota kwangu, kumbiti wawezandiri kung'ambira mana yakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />Shakapanu, kiza Daniyeli, yakashemwa viraa Betelishaza, litawu lyakuyi mlungu gwangu, mweni rohu ya wamlungu wananagala wawera mngati mwakuyi. Na neni nimtambira kulota kwangu panonga. <verse eid="DAN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />Gwee Betishaza, yaguwera mkulu gwa waganga, nivimana kuwera rohu ya wamlungu wananagala wawera mngati mwaku na kwahera bada yayiwera ikamala kwaku. Aku ndo kulota kwa neni gung'ambili mana yakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />Paweriti ng'onja, moniti malola aga. Moniti kwana mtera mtali nentu pakatikati pa isi. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Mtera guweriti mkulu na gukamala na upeleru wakuyi usoka kumpindi. Guweziti kuwoneka kulawa kila pahala pasipanu. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Mihambi yakuyi yiweriti iherepa. Guweriti gumema mabwajubwaju, ntambu ya kupatosiya pasipanu poseri. Wankanyama woseri wa kuntundu wapatiti shivuniru pasi pakuyi na wampongu wa kulyera walikala muntambi zakuyi. Viwumbi vyoseri vipatiti shiboga kulawa mtera agu.<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />Paweriti nankugonja pashitanda shangu, moniti malola aga. Moniti malaika mnanagala kasuluka kulawa kumpindi. <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />Kashema pakabota, Mgukati mtera agu na kuzidumula ntambi zakuyi. Mpatuli mihamba yakuyi na kugapalasiya mabwajubwaju gakuyi. Wankanyama wawuki pasipakuyi na wampongu kulawa muntambi zakuyi waguluki. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Kumbiti mleki shisiki shakuyi na mishigila yakuyi mlitapaka, kumihambi miwisi ya kululalanda payiwera itawalirwa panu kwa minyololu ya shuma na shaba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:15">Mmuleki muntu ayu kaloviwi kwa mangami ga kumpindi, mmuleki kalikali pamuhera na wankanyama wa kuntundu na kuliya mihambi kushiwala. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Mahala gakuyi ga umuntu gagalambulwi, kaweri na mahala ga wankanyama kwa vinja saba. <verse eid="DAN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />Toza ayi ndo yayibweritwi na malaika, ndo gawajimiraniti na yawawera wananagala, su wantu woseri kila pahala wapati kuvimana kuwera Mlungu Mkulu kana ukulu kwa falumi zoseri za wantu, yomberi kampanana ufalumi muntu yoseri yakamfira, kamtenda kaweri mfalumi ata muntu gwa pasi gwa upeleru.<verse eid="DAN 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />Kulota aku ndo ndotiti neni Nebukadineza, Vinu gwenga Belitishaza, gung'ambili mana yakuyi, mana wana luhala woseri muufalumi wangu wawezandiri kung'ambira mana yakuyi, toziya gwenga haguwezi mana rohu ya wamlungu wananagala wamngati mwaku.<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniyeli kalonga mana ya kulota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Shakapanu Daniyeli, yawamshemiti viraa Betelishaza, kalikangasha katepu na maholu gakuyi gamhinginiziya. Mfalumi kamgambira, “Betelishaza kulota aku, ama mana yakuyi navikuhinginiziya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:19">Betelishaza, kamwankula, Mtuwa gwangu, kulota aku na mana yakuyi meyiweri mbaka kwa wankondu waku!” <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Mtera yaguguwoniti guwera mkulu na yagwana likakala, gweni ntambi zakuyi ntali zisoka kumpindi na gweni guwoneka kulawa kila pahala pasipanu. <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />Mihamba yakuyi iwera iherepa na mabwajubwaju gakuyi gavuwa gakuliyiziya viwumbi vyoseri, wankanyama wa kuntundu wapata shivuni pasi pakuyi na wampongu wa kulyera pawalikala muntambi zakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />Gwee mfalumi ndo gwenga yaguwera mkulu na yagwana likakala. Ukulu waku usoka mpaka kumpindi na ufalumi waku weneya mpaka upeleru wa pasipanu. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Gwee mfalumi gwenga guwoniti kayi, Mlolera mnanagala kasuluka kulawa kumpindi, kalagalira, Mgudumuli mtera agu mwakagwagamiziyi. Kumbiti mshileki shipiki shakuyi na mishigira yakuyi pasi pamihambi miwisi ya kululalanda, payiwera shitawalirwa mnyololu gwa shuma na shaba. Mmuleki muntu ayu kaloviwi kwa mangami ga kumpindi, mleki kalikali pamuhera na wankanyama wa kundundu kwa vinja saba.<verse eid="DAN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />Gwee mfalumi, ayi ndo mana ya kulota kwaku, ndo lagiru yakawera kumpindi nentu yakayilaviyiti kwa mtuwa gwangu mfalumi. <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />Gwee mfalumi, haguwigwi gugendi kutali na wantu! Hagulikali na wankanyama wa kuntundu, haguliyi mihambi gambira ng'ombi, hagulowi kwa mangami ga kumpindi. Hagulikali ntambu iraayi kwa vinja saba na upeleru hagumani kuwera Mlungu Mkulu ndo yakana uwezu kwa falumi za wantu na kampanana ufalumi muntu yoseri yakamfira. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Kayi lagiru ilii ya kushileka shipiki na mishigira ya mtera agu mulitapaka ina mana ayi. Gwenga haguwuzililwi kayi ufalumi waku paguvimana kuwera Mlungu gwa kumpindi ndo mkolamlima. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Gwee mfalumi, shondi gupikinili shanikugambiziya, guleki vidoda vyaku na makondola gaku, gutendi shashifiruwa na kuwawonera lusungu yawapunjitwi pamonga hagulikali kwa ponga na kunemelara.<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Goseri aga gampatiti mfalumi Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Miyezi kumi na miwili shakapanu, mfalumi Nebukadineza kaweriti kankutyanga pashintwiku handa litala. <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />Su mfalumi katakula kwa kubota, “Guloli Babeli, mji mkulu yanigunyawiti kwa makakala gangu guweri pahala pangu pa kulikala pa shifalumi na kwajili ya uweru wangu.”<verse eid="DAN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />Pakalongiti visoweru avi, liziwu kulawa kumpindi lilonga, “Gwee mfalumi Nebukadineza, gupikiniri ulagilagi awu kwajili ya gwenga! Upokwa ufalumi waku. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />Haguwigwi kutali na wantu! Hagulikali pamuhera na wankanyama wa kuntundu na haguliyi mihambi gambira ng'ombi! Hagulikali muntambu ayi kwa vinja saba na upeleru haguvimani kuwera Mlungu Mkulu ndo yakana uwezu kwa falumi za wantu na kampanana muntu yoseri yakamfira.”<verse eid="DAN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Palapalii mlandu agu kwa mfalumi Nebukadineza guwera. Kawingitwi kaweri kutali na wantu, kawera kankuliya mihambi gambira ng'ombi. Kalowa kwa mangami ga kumpindi na mviri zakuyi ziwera ntali na vuluvulu gambira mibahira ya mpongu kapungu. Na mikonji yakuyi iwera gambira ya mpongu.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nebukadineza kamzyuma Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />Mushinja sha saba kupera, neni Nebukadineza nyasuliti masu gangu kulola kumpindi na mahala gangu gambuyira. Nongiti mayagashi Mlungu Mkulu na kumpanana ligoya yomberi yakalikala mashaka goseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">Toziya ukulu wakuyi ndo ukulu wa mashaka goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">ufalumi wakuyi ulikala wiwuka mpaka wiwuka.<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />Wenikaya woseri wa pasipanu ndo shintundiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">katenda vyakafira na viwumbi vya kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">na wenikaya wa pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">kwahera yakaweza kumlewelera ama kulonga gutenda shishi.<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />Shaka shiraashi mahala gangu gambuyira, mbuziliritwi ligoya lyangu, ukulu wangu na uweru wa ufalumi waneni. Watakuziya na maafisa wangu wiziti kunsakula, mpuziyitwi muufalumi wangu na kupananwa ligoya gambira pakwanja.<verse eid="DAN 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />Su vinu, neni Nebukadineza nivimana kumkwisa na kumpanana ligoya mfalumi gwa kumpindi. Mana matendu gakuyi goseri ndo gamfiriziya, yomberi kawasulusiya wanamtiti.<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s">Belishaza kanguwashema wantu wizi kuliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Lishaka limu mfalumi Belishaza kawasemiti wantu wavuwa wizi kuliya na kulanda divayi pamuhera na yomberi. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Shaka Belishaza pakaweriti kankulanda divayi yakuyi, kahimiziyiti wajegi vikombi vya zahabu na feza vyeni Nebukadineza tati gwa Berishaza, kaweriti kavitola kulawa Kunumba Nkulu nanagala ya Mlungu aku Yerusalemu, su mfalumi na walonguziya wakuyi, wadala wakuyi na wadala wa kunja wavilandiri. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Hangu wajega vikombi vilii vya zahabu vyeni viweriti vitolwa kulawa Munumba Nkulu nanagala ya Mlungu aku Yerusalemu, na yomberi mfalumi na walonguziya wakuyi na wadala wakuyi wa kunja wavilandira. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Pawaweriti wankulanda divayi, wawazuma wamlungu yawanyawitwi kwa mabuhi ga zahabu na feza na shaba na shuma na mitera na mabuwi.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Vumu vyala vya shiwoku sha muntu vilawiriti na kulemba pampindi pa shibambaza, pakwegera na shintambi sha koloboyi mngati mnumba ya mfalumi. Mfalumi kalola shiwoku ntambu yashiweriti shankulemba. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />Sheni sha mfalumi shigalambu langi na yomberi katiriti nentu hangu manung'unu gakuyi galibondangiti na magulu gakuyi galegeya. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />Mfalumi Belishaza kalagalira washemwi wahawi wa Wakalidayu na wanaluhala na walola ntondu wajegwi. “Pawajegitwi, mfalumi kawagambira wana luhala awa wa Babuloni, yoseri yakabetula malembu aga na kung'ambiziya mana yakuyi, hakavalasiwi nguwu za zambalawu na ukufu wa zahabu msingu mwakuyi na hakaweri gwa tatu mu walongoziwa wakulu.” <verse eid="DAN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Shakapanu, wanaluhala woseri wa mfalumi wiza, kumbiti wasindiliti kugabetula malembu aga pota kumgambira mfalumi mana yakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Su, mfalumi Belishaza katiliti nentu na rangi yakuyi iyongeriti kugalambuka, na walonguziya wakuyi wawera na lyoga.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Mawu gwakuyi mfalumi Belishaza pakapikiniliti liziwu lya walonguziya wakuyi kiziti kingira muligeleri lya kuliya kalonga, “Gwee mfalumi gulikali mashaka goseri. Nagulilimuka! Nagugalambuka langi ntambu ayi. <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />Kwana muntu muufalumi waku mweni kana rohu wa wamlungu wananagala mngati mwakuyi. Shaka sha tati gwaku, muntu ayu kawonikaniti kuwera na umani, mahala na luhala gambira lulii lwa wamlungu. Mfalumi Nebukadineza tati gwaku, kamtumiti kuwera mkulu gwa waganga na wahawi na walola ntondu na watunga. <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />Muntu ayu wamshema Daniyeli, mweni tati gwaku kamshemiti Beliteshaza, kawoneka kuwera na mahala gayewuka, mahala na umani, viraa kana makakala ga kutakulira kulota na kutakulira mairandu ya bada na kuwusiya mirandu ikamala. Mumshemi Daniyeli na yomberi hakakugambiri mana ya malebwa aga.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniyeli kankutakulira visoweru vyavilembitwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Su Daniyeli kajegwa kulongolu kwa mfalumi, “Na yomberi mfalumi kamkosiya, hashi, gwenga ndo Daniyeli, yumu gwa wantu wa uhamisiwu yawajegitwi na tati gwangu mfalumi kulawa Yuda? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Mpikinira kuwera wamlungu wakupanana gwenga umani, mahala na luhala lwa kukangasha. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Wana luhala na wahawi pawajegwitwi kwaneni su wasomi na kutakulira mana ya malembu aga, wasinditi. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Kumbiti, mpikinira handa gwenga gumana kila shintu na kutakuli mana yakuyi. Handa paguweza kubetula malembu aga na kung'ambira mana yakuyi, haguvasiwi nguwu za zambalawu na kuvalisiwa ukufu wa zahabu msingi mwaku. Haguweri muntu gwa tatu muufalumi awu.”<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />“Daniyeli kamwankula, mfalumi Belishaza, mafupu gaku gusigali naga gwee mfalumi ama kumpanana muntu yumonga. Gwee mfalumi, hanikubetuliri malembu aga kukugambira mana yakuyi.”<verse eid="DAN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />Gwee mfalumi, Mlungu Mkulu kampanana tati gwaku Nebukadineza, ufalumi, ukulu na kuzumwa na kupananwa ligoya. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Toziya ya ukulu yawampananiti, wantu wa makabila goseri, maisi goseri na luga zoseri yawalendemeriti na kumtira. Nebukadineza kaweziti kumlaga muntu yoseri yakafiriti na kumleka mkomu yoseri yakafiliti. Yakafiriti kumkweniziya muukulu kamkweniziya, yakafiliti kumsulusiya ukulu kamsulusiyiti. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Kumbiti pakaweriti na mtiti panu, kawusiyitwi mushiti shakuyi sha ukulu, kapokwa uweru wakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />Kawingitwi kutulwa kutali na wantu, mahala gakuyi gawera gambira ga nkanyama, kalikala na punda gwa kuntundu, kawera kankuliya ntundu gambira ng'ombi. Katowerwa mvula munshimba mpaka pakavimaniti kuwera Mlungu Mkulu ndo yakakolamlima falumi za wantu, nayomberi kamtula mfalumi yoseri yakamfira.<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />Kumbiti gwenga Belishaza, mwana gwa Nebukadineza, tembera gugamana goseri aga, gulinanagaziya ndiri! <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />Pa kulinanagaziya mweni, guwera mgalambuku kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwa kumpindi. Gujega vyombu vya numba ya Mlungu, na guvilandira divayi, gwenga na maafisa waku, wadala waku na wadala waku wa kunja na kuwazyuma wamlungu yawanyawitwi kwa mabuhi ga feza na zahabu na shaba na shuma na mitera na mabuhi gamonga, wamlungu weni wawonandiri, wapikinirandiri pota kuvimana shoseri. Kumbiti gumkwisandiri Mlungu, mweni ukomu waku wa mumawoku mwakuyi, na njira zaku za lupalahera kulongolu kwakuyi gumpanana ndiri ligoya! <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Su, Mlungu katuma liwoku lilembi malembu aga.<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />Visoweru vyeni ndo. MENI, MENI, TEKELI NA PERESI. <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />Mana ya visoweru avi ndo. MENI Mlungu kagawalanga mashaka ga ufalumi waku na kagumalira. <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />Tekeli. Gwenga gupimwa mumizani na guwoneka gutopandiri. <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />Peresi mana yakuyi ndo, ufalumi waku upokwa na kupananwa Wamedi na Waperisi.<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Panu, mfalumi Belishaza kahimiziya Daniyeli kavalasiwi nguwu za gweka za zambalawu na ukufu wa zahabu msingu. Kabwerwa kuwera Daniyeli hakawera gwa tatu muufalumi. <verse eid="DAN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />Pashiru palapalii, Belishaza mfalumi gwa Babeli, kalaguwa, <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />na mfalumi Dario muntu kulawa Medi kawera mkolamlima pakawera na vinja sitini na viwili.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s">Daniyeli mulilindi la simba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Mfalumi Dario kalagalira kusyagula wakulu miya ishilini wamtangi muukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />Kawasyaguliti wagolokera watatu na yumu gwawu kaweriti Daniyeli. Walaviyiti walanga kwa wagolokera su mahengu ga mfalumi gagendi teratera. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Su, Daniyeli katenditi lihengu weli kuliku muwamu mwa wagolokera na wakulu, kaweriti weli mulihengu lyakuyi, ata mfalumi kaliholiti kumtula muugolokela mkulu gwa ufalumi woseri. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Wakulu walii pamuhera na wagolokera waweriti na weya, ata wasakula madoda su wamgambiri Mfalumi, kumbiti wawezandiri kupata ntambu ya kumlawumu, pota likosa, toziya Daniyeli kaweriti mwaminika. Kaweritindiri na madoda pota makontola goseri. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Su wantu walii watakuliti weni kwa weni hangu. “Hapeni tupati shoseri sha kumsitaki Daniyeli pamonga tusakuli shintu shakashitenda shashilawilana na lagiru lya Mlungu gwakuyi.”<verse eid="DAN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />“Su, wagolokera na wakulu wingira kwa mfalumi kwa pamuhera na kulonga, Gwee Mfalumi Dario, gulikali mashaka goseri! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Wagolokera wa shifalumi, watanga, wakulu, watakuziya na wakolamlima woseri wajimilirana mfalumi kalaviyi lagiru na kutenda wantu wankuyitenda mumashaka selasini yoseri yakamluwa mlungu ama muntu ila gwenga hera mfalumi, hakaswi mung'ati mwalilindi lya simba. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />Gwee mfalumi, vinu gulaviyi lagiru na guyilembi su nayigalambulwa, kulinganira na lagiru za Wamedi na Wajemi, lagiru lyeni nayigalamburwa.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Su, mfalumi Dario katula shimaniziwu. <verse eid="DAN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Daniyeli pakavimaniti kuwera lilembu lilii litulwa shimaniziwu, kagenditi kunumba kwakuyi mugolofa lya shumba shakuyi yashiweriti na madilisha yagavugukiti kulola Yerusalemu. Ntambu yayiwera mashaka goseri Daniyeli kasundamaliti mala tatu kila lishaka na kuluwa pakalonga mayagashi kwa Mlungu gwakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Wantu walii yawayoweriti na mfalumi wamwoniti Daniyeli pakamluwa Mlungu gwakuyi kamtangi. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Su, wakulu walii wagenditi kwa mfalumi na kumsitaki Daniyeli kwa kulola lagiru ayi, pawalonga, gwee Mfalumi Dario, hashi gutulandiri shimaniziwu mulirembu lya lagiru kuwera kwa shaka sha mashaka selasini kwahera muntu yoseri yakajimirwa kuluwa shintu shoseri, kwa mlungu yoseri, ama kwa muntu yoseri ila kukuluwa gwenga, gwee mfalumi na yoseri yakajimirandiri lagiru ali hakasirwi mulilindi lwa simba?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:12">Mfalumi kankula, “Shamtakula shanakaka, kulinganira na lagiru lya Wamedi na Waperesi yeni hapeni igalambulwi.”<verse eid="DAN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Shakapanu wamgambira mfalumi kuwera, “Daniyeli ulii yakaweriti yumu gwa malopola kulawa isi ya Yuda kapananandiri ligoya lagiru yagutuliti na kulilemba. Yomberi kankuluwa mala tatu kila lishaka.”<verse eid="DAN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Shaka mfalumi pakapikaniliti visoweru avi, kahinginikiti nentu. Kajeriti kumlopola Daniyeli, yomberi kendeleya kutenda kila ntambu ya kumlopola mpaka mshenji pagwinaliti. <verse eid="DAN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />“Wantu walii wamgendera kwa pamuhera mfalumi Dario na kumgambira, gwee mfalumi, guvimana kuwera kwahera lagiru ama lagaliru lyoseri lya Wamedi na Wapelesi yayiweza kugalambulwa payitulwa shimaniziwu na mfalumi.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Su, mfalumi kalagalira, na womberi wamjega Daniyeli na kumwasira mngati mlilindi lya simba. Mfalumi kamgambira Daniyeli, “Mlungu gwaku yagumtendera mashaka goseri hakulopoli.” <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Libuhi lijegwa na kulitula paligomi lya lipanga lilii. Mfalumi kalitula shimaniziwu shakuyi mweni na shilii sha walonguziya wakuyi, su galii yagatakulitwi kuusu Daniyeli na kamlaviya. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />Shakapanu mfalumi kawuya muliboma na koyakuliya na katendandiri msambu gwa ntambu yoseri na kapatandiri mpota.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Mandawira putiputi, mfalumi Dario kimuka, kagenda kalongola kulipanga lya simba. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Pakasokiti pakwegera na lirindi kamshema Daniyeli kwahinginiku pakalonga, “Daniyeli, ntumintumi gwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu! Hashi, Mlungu gwaku yagumtendera mashaka goseri kaweza kuwatenda simba awa nawakuliya?”<verse eid="DAN 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Daniyeli kamwankula mfalumi, “Gwee mfalumi, gulikali mashaka goseri! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />Mlungu gwangu kajegiti malayika gwakuyi na kudiwa milomu ya simba awa, na weni wantendandiri shoseri, Mlungu katenditi hangu toziya kamaniti neni nahera lawama yoseri kwakuyi na pota hanenitendi shoseri shidoda kulongolu kwaku.”<verse eid="DAN 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />Panu mfalumi kanemelera nentu, kalagalira Daniyeli kalaviwi mulilindi. Su wamlaviya na yomberi kaweriti hakeni tenderwi shoseri na simba awa, toziya Daniyeli kawera kankumtumbira nentu Mlungu gwakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Mfalumi kalagalira wantu walii yawamshongiriti Daniyeli wabatwi na kwaswirwa mulilindi lilii lya simba pamuhera na wadala wawu na wana wawu woseri, pamberi haweni shinkuli pasi, simba wawapapuliti na kubenangabenanga mihonju yawu.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Shakapanu mfalumi Dario kawalembera wantu wa makabila goseri, maisi goseri na luga zoseri pasipanu pakalonga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:25">“Niwafilira ponga ivuwa! <verse eid="DAN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />Handaviyi lagaliru kwa wantu woseri muufalumi waneni wamjimiri na kumguwira Mlungu gwa Daniyeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">Yomberi ndo Mlungu yakawera mkomu, yakalikala mashaka goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">ufalumi wakuyi wa nakaka uweza ndiri kuwagamiziwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">ukolamlima wakuyi wahera upeleru.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />Yomberi kakombola na kulopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">katenda lagiru na makangashu kumpindi na pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">mana kamlopola Daniyeli kulawa mukulaguwa na simba.”<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Shakapanu Daniyeli kawera mkulu nentu muukolamlima wa mfalumi Dario na muufalumi wa Koreshi kulawa Wajemi.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s">Daniyeli kawona Wankanyama wakulu wamsheshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />Mshinja sha kwanja sha ukolamlima gwa mfalumi Belishaza gwa Babeli, Daniyeli kalotiti na kuwona malola pakawera kagonja pashitanda pakuyi. Kalembiti kulota kwakuyi hangu. <verse eid="DAN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />“Neni Daniyeli moniti mumawonu pashiru, lyega kulawa wega zoseri za msheshi za pasipanu pazizidodisiya bahali nkulu. <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />Wanyawa wakalipa kayi wakulu wamsheshi, wagoloka kulawa mubahali amu, kila yumu kagweka na myaguyi. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />Kanyama gwa kwanja kaweriti gambira simba na kaweriti na mbapatiru zakuyi gambira kapungu, Noliti mpaka mpapatiru zakuyi ziwusiwa na yomberi kanyasulitwi na kugoloka kwa magulu mawili gambira muntu. Shakapanu kapananwa mahala gambira muntu.”<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />Kanyama gwa pili kaweriti nkanyama yawamshema dubu magulu gakuyi ga kumberi gaweriti ganyasuka. Mumlomu gwakuyi kaweriti na mihonju mitatu yakayikola mumenu mwakuyi. Naliziwu lipikanika, “Vinu guliyi vinofu vivuwa ntambu yaguweza.”<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />“Pa aga, nimwoniti kanyama yumonga. Ayu kaweriti handa duma yakaweriti na mbapatiru za msheshi gambira za mpongu mumgongu mwakuyi. Kaweriti na mituwi msheshi na kapananwiti ukulu wa kukolamlima.<verse eid="DAN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />Mumalola gangu aga ga pashiru nimwoniti kanyama gwa msheshi gwa kulikangasha na gwa kutiriziya, yakana makakala nentu. Ayu kaweriti na menu makulu ga shuma geni kagatendela kuliya na kumegangameganga mihonju na kugatimbangatimbanga masigala kwa nzayu zakuyi na kaweriti gweka na wankanyama wamonga yawaweriti kumberi kwakuyi, mweni kaweriti na magoli lilongu. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />Paweriti nankugalola magoli aga, moniti ligoli limonga lididini lyankumera muwamu mwa magoli gamonga kumi galii, magoli matatu ga kwanja gatupulwa su kulipanana lupenu lididini ali. Ligoli ali liweriti na masu handa ga muntu na mlomu yagutakula visoweru vya kulitumba.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaguwa kwa wankanyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />Paweriti nankali nankulola, viti vya ufalumi vitulitwi panu, shakapanu mzewi gwa makashu na makashu kiza kalivaga. Kaweriti kavala nguwu nelu mbuu, mvili zakuyi ziweriti nsheri nentu. Shiti shakuyi sha ukulu shiweriti sha milipulipu ya motu na maguludumu ga shiti shakuyi gaweriti ga motu yagwaka. <verse eid="DAN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />Shishemba sha motu shiweriti shankunyililika palupita kulongolu kwakuyi. Maelufu elufu ga malayika wankumtendera, kumi elufu mala kumi elufu wagoloka kulongolu kwakuyi. Mahakama gawera kala kutoza na vitabu vivugulwa.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />Pandeleyiti kulola toziya ya visoweru vilii vya kulitumba yavitakulitwi na ligoli lilii. Endereyiti kulola mpaka kanyama ulii pakalikitulitwi na nshimba yakuyi ihalibiwa na kwaswa mumotu gulii yagwaka. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Wakanyama wamonga walii wapokitwi ukulu wawu wa kukolamlima, kumbiti weni walekwa wendereyi kulikala kwa mashaka mashididini.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />Mumalola gangu ga pashiru noliti, kulongolu kwa neni nimwoniti yakalifana na muntu, pakiza pamuhera na mawundi ga kumpindi. Kamsegelera Mzewi ayu gwa Makashu, na kalonguziwa kulongolu kwakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />Kapananwa ukulu, uweru na ufalumi, su wantu wa makabila goseri, maisi goseri na luga zoseri wamtenderi. Ukolamlima wakuyi wa mashaka goseri na ufalumi wakuyi wahera upeleru.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malola gankufafanuliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />Malola yanigawoniti neni Daniyeli gantiliziyiti na gahinginiziya nentu mumoyu. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Nimsegeleliti yumu gwawu gwa malayika walii yawagolokiti palii na kumkosiya mana yeni ya mirandu yoseri ayi. Nayomberi kantambira na kung'ambiziya mana yakuyi.” <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />“Wakanyama wamsheshi awa wakulu ndo wafalumi wamsheshi hawalawiri pasipanu. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Kumbiti wantu wa Mlungu Mkulu hawapananwi ufalumi, na weni hawuwukolimlima ufalumi awu mashaka goseri pota upeleru.”<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />“Shakapanu nfiriti kuvimana mana ya kanyama ayu gwa msheshi, mweni kaweriti kalifanandiri na wamonga woseri walii kayi gwa kutiriziya, na kwaweriti na menu ga shuma na mikonji ya shaba, nkanyama mweni kaponditiponditi na kwangamiza wankondu wakuyi na kutimbanga shoseri yashisigaliti. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Viraa neni nfiriti kuvimana kuusu magoli kumi galii pampindi pa mtuwi gwakuyi na viraa kumana kuusu ligoli limonga yalilawiriti, pamberi magoli matatu aga ageni tomoli, ligoli lilii liwoneka lyana makakala nentu kuliku gamonga galii, ligoli ali laliweriti lyana masu na mlomu lyalitakuliti visoweru vya kulitumba liwonekaniti lyana makakala kuliku gamonga.<verse eid="DAN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />Panweriti nankali kulola, ligoli ali likomangiti nkondu na wananagala na kuwakanka. <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />Shakapanu mzewi gwa makashu na makashu kagoloka na kuwapanana ukanka wantu wakuyi awa ufalumi toziya lishaka lyawu lakupananwa ukolamlima lisoka.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />Malayika kang'ambira hangu. Kanyama yulii gwa msheshi ndo ufalumi wa msheshi hawuweri pasipanu. Ufalumi awu hawuweri wa gweka na falumi zimonga, weni hawuwagamiziyi pasipanu poseri. Hawuwugusiyi pasi na kuyipandanga vipandivipandi. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Magoli galii lilongu ndo wafalumi lilongu yawalawirana na ufalumi awu. Shakapanu hawafatwi na mfalumi yumonga mweni hakaweri gweka na walii yawamlongoleriti na hakawagusiyi wafalumi watatu. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />Hakatakuli visoweru vya upaya kwa gwakumpindi nentu na kuwawonera wantu wa Mlungu, pakajera kugalambula misambu yawu minanagala pamuhera na lagiru. Wananagala hawatulwi pasi pa ukulu wakuyi kwa shaka na vyaka viwili na nusu shaka. <verse eid="DAN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Kumbiti Shotelamotu sha kumpindi hashilikali, hawampoki ukolamlima wakuyi na womberi hawuwusiwi na kwagamiziwa nakamu.” <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />“Ufalumi na ukolamlima na ukulu wa falumi zoseri pasipanu hawapananwi wantu wa Mlungu Mkulu. Ufalumi wawu hawuweri wa kulikala mashaka goseri na kolamlima zoseri haziwatenderi na kuwajimira.<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />Awu ndo upeleru wamlandu agu. Maholu gangu ganilimuziyiti nentu neni Daniyeli, ata sheni shangu shigalambuka. Visoweru vilii kandeleyiti kuvihola.”<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s">Malola ga Daniyeli ga kondolu shipalu na mbuzi pongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Mushinja sha tatu sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Belishaza gwa Babeli, neni Daniyeli, mpatiti malola gamonga. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />Mumalola aga, niliwoniti na kumji mkulu gwa Susa yaguweriti mkowa gwa Elamu. Weriti ng'oloka kumbeku mwa lushemba Ulai. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />Pandoliti, moniti kondolu shipalu kagoloka kumbeku mwa lushemba Ulai. Kondolu ayu kaweriti na magoli mawili, kumbiti ligoli limu liweriti litali nentu kuliku limonga, na lyeni iyendeleyiti kukula kuliku ya kwanja. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Nimwoniti kondolu shipalu ayu pakakomanga kugenda kwaguzyeta mshenji, kushana na kusika. Kwahera nkanyama yoseri yakajeriti kulikoma na yomberi, pota kugashapira makakala gakuyi. Katenditi ntambu yakafira, na kawera na makakala nentu.<verse eid="DAN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />Paweriti nankulihola shitwatira ashi, moniti mbuzi pongu yumu, kulawa uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji kiza kalongola pota kushinkula pasi. Kaweriti na ligoli likulu pakati pa masu gakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />Kamgendiriti kondolu ulii shipalu yakana magoli mawili kumtuwi, yanimwoniti kagoloka kumbeku kulushemba, kamkomanga kwa makakala gakuyi goseri. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Nimwoniti pakamkomanga kondolu shipalu ulii kwa kukalalira nentu, hangu kamkomanga kwa likakala na kugameganga magoli gakuyi mawili. Kondolu shipalu ulii kawelitindiri na makakala ga kumkaka mbuzi pongu ayu, su wamgusiya pasi na kutimbangwatimbangwa pota kuwera na yoseri gwa kumlopola mumakakala ga mbuzi pongu ayu.<verse eid="DAN 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Su, mbuzi pongu ulii kaweriti na makakala nentu. Kumbiti pakaweriti na makakala nentu ligoli lyakuyi likulu litupuka. Pahala palii pameliti magoli ga msheshi yagawonikiti paweru, pagawera galola wega za msheshi za pasipanu. <verse eid="DAN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Mumagoli aga ga msheshi, lilawiti ligoli limu lididini, likuliti nentu kugenda uwega wa kusika kwagulawa mshenji na kugenda isi ilii iherepa nentu. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />Ligoli ali liweriti na makakala kufikira lishonta lya kulyera lyeni ndo ntondu, ilitulusiya pasi limu lya lishonta lilii lya ntondu na kuzitimbangatimba. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />Ligoli ali lilikwisa kuliku Mtuwa Mlungu gwa kumpindi. Na kuwalewelera wantu kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziwa zyeni Mlungu gwa kumpindi kalavilirwa kila lishaka na kuhalibisiya Numba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Toziya ya ukontola awu, wantu wa Mlungu pamuhera na tambiku zakuyi za kulunguziwa kila lishaka kapananitwi ligoli ali na wantu walemiti kujimira unakaka. Su ligoli ali liweriti na uwezu wakutenda kila shintu.<verse eid="DAN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />“Shakapanu, nimpikinira malayika yumu pakayowera na myaguyi. Myaguyi ayu kamkosiyiti, hashi mirandu ayi yayibweritwi na malola aga hagendereyi kwa shaka gaa? Kwa shaka gaa tambiku za kulunguziwa kila lishaka haziyendeleyi kulekwa kutendeka? Kwa shaka gaa upotuziya wa kwagamiziya kila shintu hawendereyi na Numba ya Mlungu pamuhera na wantu wa Mlungu hawendeleyi kutimbangwa?”<verse eid="DAN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Malayika ulii gwa kwanja kankula, “Hapaweri mashaka elufu mbili na miya tatu pamihi na mandawira. Shakapanu Munumba ya Mlungu hayilumikwi kayi.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumintumi gwa Kumpindi Gabriyeli katakula mana ya malola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Neni Daniyeli panigawoniti malola aga, na panjeriti kuvimana mana yakuyi, vumu, ntumintumi gwa kumpindi yumu yakaweriti gambira muntu kagoloka kulongolu kwa neni. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />“Mpikinira liziwu lya muntu kulawa mulushemba Ulai palishema, Gabliyeli, gumgambili muntu ayu mana ya malola gakawoniti.” <verse eid="DAN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />“Gabliyeli kiza pakwegera na pahala pangolokiti. Neni ntiriti nentu, nguwiti makukama. Kumbiti kang'ambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 8:17">muntu gwenga, guvimani kuwera malola yagugawoniti gawusu mashaka ga upeleru.” <verse eid="DAN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />Pakaweriti kankuyowera na neni, weliti nahera makakala nentu ng'onja makukama. Kumbiti yomberi kankola pakangolusiya. <verse eid="DAN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />“Shakapanu kang'ambira gupikinili, hanikugambiri shashifira kulawira, Mlungu pakawera na maya. Malola aga hagalawiri mashaka sha upeleru.”<verse eid="DAN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />Kondolu shipalu ulii yagumwoniti yakana magoli mawili, galangaziya wafalumi wa Mediya na Perisia. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Mbuzi pongu ulii kana vinyolewu vivuwa ndo kagangaziya mfalumi gwa Ugiriki. Ligoli likulu pakati pa masu gakuyi ndo mfalumi gwa kwanja gwa ugiliki. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Ligoli lilii lyalimegikiti na pa gakuyi gamela magoli ga msheshi, mana yakuyi ndo ufalumi wumu awu hawulibaguli kuwera falumi msheshi, kumbiti falumi azi hapeni ziweri na makakala gambira ufalumi uli wa kwanja.<verse eid="DAN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />Pa falumi azi kusoka upeleru wakuyi na ukontola pawuwela uvuwa nentu, hapalawiri mfalumi yumu yakatabisiya na mjanjamjanja na kakalipa. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />Hakaweri kana makakala nentu, hakajegi maagamiziya madoda na hakatendi shoseri shakashifira kushitenda. Hakawagamiziyi wantu wanakakakala na wantu wa Mlungu. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />Kwa ujanjaujana wakuyi, hakatendi shoseri shakashifira kwa kuwanzanga wantu na yomberi hakalikwisi mweni. Hakawagamiziyi wantu wavuwa pota womberi kuvimana, na hakafiri kulikomanga na Mlungu, Kumbiti mfalumi ayu mjanjamjanja hakaagamiziwi pota kutendera makakala ga muntu. <verse eid="DAN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />Malola galii ga mashaka ga tambiku ga pamihi na mandawira geni gupananwa ndo ga nakaka. Su nagumgambira muntu yoseri toziya ndo ga bada, na hashipiti shaka shitali mpaka galawili.<verse eid="DAN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />Pa goseri aga neni Daniyeli ndwaliti kwa mashaka saba. Shakapanu nimukiti na nendeleyiti kutenda mahengu kwa mfalumi. Kumbiti malola galii gankangashiti ata wezandiri kugamana.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s">Daniyeli kankuwaluwira wantu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />Mushinja sha kwanja sha kukolamlima kwakuyi Dario yakaweriti mwana gwa Ahasuwelo mwiwuka gwa Umedi, mweni katendwa mkolamlima gwa ufalumi wa Babeli, <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" />Mushinja sha kwanja sha kukolamlima kwakuyi mfalumi Dario, neni Daniyeli, nivimaniti mana ya malembu na mana ya visoweru vya Mtuwa Mlungu vyakalembiti mbuyi Yerimiya, kuwera Yerusalemu meguhalibisiwi kwa vinja sabini. <verse eid="DAN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Nimluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu kwa moyu goseri pamuhera na koya kuliya na kuvala nguwu za mafafa na kukala mumalivu kulanguziya nankuhinginika. <verse eid="DAN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />“Nimluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu na kumgalambukila Mlungu na kuleka vidoda panonga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 9:4">Gwee Mtuwa, gwenga ndo Mlungu mkulu na gwa kupananwa ligoya. Gwenga ndo mwaminika kwa lipatanu lyaku na guwatanga yawafira kujimira lagiru zaku.<verse eid="DAN 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />Tutenda vidoda na tutenda makontola, tugalambuka gwenga na tuleka malagalira gaku na lagiru zaku. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Tuwapikinirandiri wantumintumi waku wambuyi, weni wayowiliti na wafalumi wetu, wakulu wetu, wazewi wetu na wantu woseri wa isi. <verse eid="DAN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />Gwee Mtuwa, gwenga gutenda yagawera teratera, kumbiti lishaka lya leru tuwera na soni twenga wapalu wa Yuda wenikaya wa Yerusalemu na Israeli woseri yawawera pakwegera na yawawera kutali muisi, toziya twenga twahera waminika kwa gwenga. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu twenga na wafalumi wetu na wakulu wetu na watati wetu twanasoni toziya tukutendera vidoda, <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu, gwana lusungu na guwalekiziya wantu, tembera twenga tukugalambuka. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, tulemiti kukupikinira na tuzikolandiri lagiru zakuyi zagutupananiti kwa njira ya wantumintumi waku wambuyi. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Waisraeli woseri wakuleka na wayigalambuka lagiru yaku kukujimira. Toziya tukutendera vidoda, su tupangirwa kwa lapiru yayilembitwi mulagiru ya Musa ntumintumi waku. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />Hangu gutenda visoweru vilii vyagulongiti kwa twenga pamuhera na wakolamlima wetu kwa kugukomanga mji gwa Yerusalemu, nentu ya mji gumonga goseri pasipanu. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Gutukomanga ntambu yayilembitwi mulagiru ya Musa, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, kumbiti ata vinu tukuluwandiri tulekiziwi na gwenga na kuvileka vidoda vyetu na kulihola waminika waku. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, guweriti kala kutukomanga na gutenda hangu, toziya mashaka goseri gutenda yagajimilika kulongolu kwaku, kumbiti twenga tukupikinirandiri.<verse eid="DAN 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />Vinu gwee Mtuwa, Mlungu gwetu, yaguwalaviyiti wantu waku muisi ya misri kwa makakala gaku na kuwatenda wantu wagahola makakala gaku mpaka leru, tulonga tutenda vidoda na tutenda makondola <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa shiyasi sha matendu gaku gakufiriziya, naguwukalalira wantu waku pota kuwera na maya mumji gwaku Yerusalemu, gweni gugunyawa mulugongu lwaku lunanagala. Wantu woseri wa isi za pakwegera wagubeziya mji gwa Yerusalemu na wantu waku, toziya ya vidoda vyetu na makondola gawatenditi wazewi wetu.” <verse eid="DAN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />Gwee Mlungu gwetu, “Gupikinili kuluwa kwangu na maluwa gangu neni ntumintumi gwaku. Kwa mirandu yaku miheri, guyinyawi kayi numba yaku yayihalibisiwitwi. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />Gwee Mlungu, gupikinili luwa yaneni, gulori ntabiku ya mji gwaku yaguhalibisiwa, tukuluwa gwenga toziya twenga tutendandiri yagafiruwa ila tutenda vidoda. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Gwee Mtuwa gutupikiniri, Gwee Mtuwa gutulekiziyi. Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa utanga waku gutupikiniri na kututendera, pota kukawalira, toziya ya mji agu na wantu yawawera waku mweni!”<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi Gabriyeli kankutakulira umbuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />Su paweriti nankuluwa na kulonga noya vidoda vyangu na vya wantu wa Israeli, pamuhera na kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu toziya ya lugongu lwakuyi lunanagala, <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />Gabliyeli ulii, mweni weriti nimwona mumalola galii ga kwanja, kasulukiti kalongola mpaka pahala paweriti. Shiweriti shaka sha kulaviya tambiku ya pashimihi. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />“Su, kang'ambira hangu, Daniyeli niza kukupanana luhala na uwezu wa kumana malola aga.” <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />Pagwanjiti kuluwa, Mlungu kalaviyiti lyankulu, naneni niza kukugambira lyankulu ali toziya Mlungu kakufira nentu. Hangu, gupikinili weri lyankulu ali na kuvimana malola aga.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />Mumajuma sabini gatulwa toziya ya wantu waku na pampindi pa mji gwaku gunanagala su kulopolwa na kuwusiya vidoda na kulekiziya ukontola, kujega yagafiruwa kwa Mlungu mashaka goseri, kutula shimaniziwu na umbuyi na kuswaga lipaki pahala pananagala nentu. <verse eid="DAN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />Su, guvimani na gwelewi mlandu agu. Kwanjira shaka palilaviyitwi lagalira lya kunyawa kayi mji gwa Yerusalemu mpaka kwiza kwakuyi yakaswagiti lipaki, ulii yakaweriti mkulu, ndo shaka sha majuma saba. Kwa shaka sha majuma sitini na mawili, mji gwa Yerusalemu hagunyawiwi kayi, wana njira nkulu na malindi, kumbiti shaka ashi hashiweri sha ntabiku. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />Pa majuma sitini na mawili, ulii yakaswagitwi lipaki hakalaguwi na hapeni kasigalwi na shintu. Wantu pamuhera na mkolamlima hawizi na kuhalibisiya mji na pahala pananagala gambira malawa ga mashi, nkontu hayiyendeleyi ntambu yakatuliti Mlungu. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />Mkolamlima ayu hakatendi mapatanu magangamala na wantu wavuwa kwa shaka sha vinja saba. Pa nusu ya shaka ashi hakamalili tambiku na sadaka. Pashitalawanda pampindi panumba nkulu ya Mlungu hapagolusiyi nkalaliru halibisiya yeni hayisigali panu mpaka ulii yakaligolosiyiti hakaagamiziwi ntambu yayitulitwi na Mlungu.<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s">Malola ga Daniyeli kumbeku kulushemba Tigili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />Mushinja sha tatu sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Koreshi gwa uajemi, Daniyeli, yakashemitwi viraa Beliteshaza, kapananitwi ugubutulu. Ugubutulu awu uweriti wanakaka na weni utakulira ntabiku ikalipa, hangu Umani wa ulagilagi awu umwiziliti mmalola.<verse eid="DAN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Shaka ashi, neni Daniyeli, weriti nankudaya kwa majuma matatu. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />Ndiyitindiri shiboga shiherepa ama shinofu pota kulanda divayi ama niliswagandiri lipaki kwa shaka sha majuma goseri matatu aga.<verse eid="DAN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />Lishaka lya ishilini na nne lya mwezi gwa kwanja, nweriti ng'oloka kumbwega na lushemba Tigili. <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />Noliti kumpindi, nimwona muntu kavala nguwu nfufu na kalitawa lufunga lwa zahabu kulawa Ufazi mushunu. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Nshimba yakuyi iweliti gambira mabuwi ga zabarajadi iherepa. Sheni shakuyi shilifaniti na lumeta lya lupanda na masu gakuyi gayaka gambira mwaku gwa motu. Magulu na mawoku gakuyi gang'elengeta gambira shaba yayikukumulitwi nentu. Liziwu lyakuyi livumiti gambira liziwu lya umatu mkulu wa wantu.<verse eid="DAN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />Neni Daniyeli gweka yangu moniti malola aga. Walii wantu yawaweriti pamuhera na neni wagawonandiri, kumbiti waweliti na lyoga nentu, <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Hangu, ndekitwi gweka yangu panoliti malola aga ga kulikangasha. Makakala gampelera na sheni shangu shigalambuka, na kwahera muntu yakaweza kumana. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />Pampikiniriti liziwu lyakuyi, nguwiti pasi makukama na mpota zinkoliti nentu. <verse eid="DAN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Su, liwoku lishinkulu na ling'olosiya na kugangamaziya magulu na mawoku gangu.<verse eid="DAN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />“Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kang'ambira hangu, Daniyeli, Mtuwa Mlungu kakufira nentu, gugoloki na gupikinili weri visoweru vyanfira kutakula, toziya ndagalirwa kwa gwenga. Pakaweriti kang'ambira visoweru avi, neni Daniyeli ng'olokiti agawu panendemela.<verse eid="DAN 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ayu kang'ambira Daniyeli, nagutira. Mlungu kapikiniriti kuluwa kwaku kwanjira lishaka lilii lya kwanja pagwamuwiti kulinanagaziyiti kulongolu kwa Mlungu gwaku, su gupati umani. Neni niza toziya ya luwa yaku ayi. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Kumbiti mkulu gwa ufalumi wa uajemi kandiwiriti kwa shaka sha mashaka ishilini na moja. Kumbiti Mikaeli, yumu gwa wakulu wa wantumintumi wa kumpindi, kiza kuntanga, hangu nimleka aku pamuhera na mkulu gwa ufalumi wa Uajemi, <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />Na neni niza kukutanga guyimani mirandu hayiwapati wantu waku shaka shashiza, toziya malola yaguwera naga gawusu shaka shashiza.”<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Pakaweriti kang'ambira visoweru avi, ndoliti pasi wezandiri kuyowera toziya ya lyoga. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />“Shakapanu, ntumintumi gwa kumpindi yakawonekaniti handa muntu, kayishinkuliti milomu ya neni na neni mamuliti milomu yangu na kumgambira yakagolokiti ulii pakwegera na neni, gwee mtuwa, malola aga ganjegera kutama nentu mpaka mpeluwa makakala. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Gwee mtuwa gwangu neni na ntumintumi gwaku. Weza hashi kuyowera na gwenga? Makakala gangu gampelera ata nsinda kupumula!”<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi yakawonekaniti kayi gambira muntu kashingula kwa mala imonga, kantula makakala. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />Kang'ambira, “Nagutira gwee muntu yagufiruwa nentu na Mlungu. Ponga iweri kwa gwenga! Guweri mgamala na gutira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 10:19">Pakayoweliti na neni, mpatiti makakala, ntakula hangu, gutakuli shilii shagufira kungambira toziya gumpanana makakala.<verse eid="DAN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />“Na yomberi kang'ambira, hashi, guvimana ntambu gaa nikwizira? Vinu hambuyi kulikomanga na wamahoka walolera wa uajemi. Shakapanu, pawera nimkanka, lihoka mlolera gwa Ugiliki hakalawiri.” <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Kumbiti hanikugambiri galii yagalembitwi mushitabu sha nakaka. Nahera gwingi gwa kuntanga kuwakanka awa ila Mikaeli, ntumintumi gwa kumpindi mlolera gwenu.<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />Kumbiti kwa uwega waneni, mushinja sha kwanja sha mfalumi Dario kulawa Medi, neni ntumintumi gwa kumpindi nililaviyiti kumtanga na kumtula likakala mfalumi. <verse eid="DAN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />Vinu hanikugambiri unakaka ulii wa mirandu ayi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="DAN 11:2">Falumi za misri na Uajemi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 11:2">Guloli, wafalumi wamonga watatu hawayikolimlima isi ya Uajemi. Womberi hafatwi na mfalumi gwa msheshi mweni hakaweri mlunda kuliku walii yawamlongoleriti. Shakapanu pakawera na makakala na ulunda, hakanji kukomanga ufalumi wa Ugiliki.<verse eid="DAN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />Shakapanu hakalawili mfalumi mgangamala kulawa Ugiliki, hakakolimlima pahala pakulu na kutenda vyakafira. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Pa shaka sha upeleru wa uwezu wakuyi, ufalumi wakuyi hawumegeki na kubagulwa museemu za msheshi kugenda wega msheshi za mpindi. Wiwuka wakuyi hapeni ukolimlima pota ufalumi kuwera mumawoku mwa yakakolamlima, toziya ufalumi wakuyi hawutolwi na wamonga.<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />Mfalumi gwa kusika mweni ndo mfalumi gwa Misri hakaweri kana makakala nentu. Kumbiti yumu gwa mashonta wagangamala wakuyi hawaweri na likakala kuliku yomberi na ukolamlima wakuyi hawuweri mkulu nentu. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Pa vinja tunga, hawatendi mapatanu, muhinga gwa mfalumi gwa kusika hakayugwi mukaya ya mfalumi na kugolokera lipatanu lya kushana, kumbiti hapeni kendereyi kuwera na makakala, viraa mfalumi na wiwuka hapeni wahepeleri na mhinga ayu, mwana gwakuyi na wamanda wakuyi wadala yawagenditi nawu, woseri hawalaguwi. <verse eid="DAN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Shakapanu, yumu gwawu kulawa lukolu lwa mhinga ayu hakaweri mfalumi. Hakawakomangi wamashonta wa mfalumi gwa kushana na kwingira mumaboma gawu na kukanka. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Hakavipapi vinyagu vya beyi nkulu vya wamlungu wawu na vyombu vya feza na zahabu mpaka muisi ya Misri. Kwa shaka sha vinja tunga mfalumi gwa Misri hapeni kamkomangi mfalumi gwa Siliya. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Shakapanu, mfalumi ayu gwa Misri hakawukankali ufalumi wa Siliya, mpaka kawuyi muisi yakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />Wana wa mfalumi gwa Siliya hawajojoniri washonta wavuwa na kulitanda kwa nkondu. Lishonta ali halisegeleri kulongolu handa malawa gwa mashi, lishonda alii halipiti na kulikomanga nkondu mpaka liboma lya wankondu. <verse eid="DAN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Panu, mfalumi gwa Misri, kwa maya gakuyi, hakalikomangi nkondu na mfalumi gwa Siliya, mfalumi ayu gwa Siliya yakaweriti na lishonta likulu na lyeni lisinditi.<verse eid="DAN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Pa likankitwi lishonta alii lya Siliya na kulaga maelufu, hakanji kulizyuma, ila hapeni kendereyi kuwera mkanka.<verse eid="DAN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />Shakapanu mfalumi gwa Siliya hakawajojoniri wamashonta wavuwa kuliku walii wa kwanja. Pa vinja tunga hakawuyi na lishonta likulu lyaliwera na vintu vivuwa. <verse eid="DAN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />Mushaka ashi wantu wavuwa hawamlemi mfalumi gwa Misri. Wamu wa wantu wankesera wa isi yaku Daniyeli, hawagalambuki su kutenda malola aga, kumbiti hapeni waweri na mpatiru. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Mfalumi gwa Siliya hakaguzyengeti mji gweni liboma ligangamala na kugulopola. Wamashonta wa Misri hapeni wahepeleri, ata wamashonta yawamana kulikomanga nentu hapeni waweri na likakala. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Mkankala gwa Siliya hakawatendi ntambu yakafira, mana kwahera yakajera kulikomanga nayu. Hakagoloki muisi iherepa na isi yoseri ayi hayiweri ya ukolamlima wakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />Mkankala ayu gwa Siliya hakafiri kwiza na lishonta lyoseri, na yomberi hakatendi mapatanu na kugatenda. Hakamyugiziyi muhinga gwakuyi su kawagamiza ufalumi wa wankondu wakuyi, kumbiti mpangu gwakuyi hapeni guweri na mpatiru, pota kumtanga shoseri. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Shakapanu, hakagalambuli mpangu gwakuyi na kuzikomanga isi zimonga za kumpwani na kuzikanka. Kumbiti mashonta wahenga hawamkanki na kugawusiya matumbilu gakuyi mweni mfalumi gwa Siliya,mfalumi gwa Siliya hapeni kalitumbi kayi mweni, kumbiti hakaweri na soni. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Panu mfalumi gwa Siliya hakagalambuki kuwuya muliboma la isi yakuyi mweni, kumbiti hakasindi na kulagwa munkondu na awu ndo hawuweri upeleru wakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />Shakapanu hakizi mfalumi yumonga kulawa Siliya, mweni hakalagalili mtola ushulu su kugangamaziya ufalumi wakuyi. Mfalumi ayu gwa Siliya hakalaguwi mashaka madidini hera ila kwa nkondundiri toziya wantu wamkalalira.<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi mkontola gwa Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />Ntumintumi gwa Mlungu kendeleya kumgambira Daniyeli kuwera, Mfalumi gwa Siliya yakafata hakaweri gwa kubeziwa na mkontola na kafiliwa ndiri kukolamlima ufalumi, nayomberi hakizi pota kutakula na kunyasula ufalumi kwa kulisegasega. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Hakawalagi woseri yawamjimirandiri ata kaweri Mtambika gwa Numba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Kayi hakatendi mapatanu na maisi gamonga kwa uzyanga na hawendereyi kuwera na makakala ata pakakolamlima wantu wadidini. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Pota kutakula hakakankali pahala pamkowa gwana ulunda uvuwa na kutenda mirandu yeni itendekandiri, ata na yumu gwa wazewi wakuyi yawalongoleriti. Shakapanu, lunda na vintu vyakalopoliti kunkondu. Hantendi mipangu ya kugakomanga maboma, kumbiti kwa shaka shididini hera.<verse eid="DAN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />Kwa ugangamala uvuwa, hakanyawi lishonta likulu su kukomanga ufalumi wa Misri, nayomberi mfalumi gwa Misri hakawuziliri makomangu aga kwa lishonta likulu nentu na lyana likakala nentu. Kumbiti, mfalumi gwa Misri hapeni kafaulu toziya makomangu madoda hagatendwi kwa yomberi. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Watakuziya wakuyi wa pakwegera ndo hawamwagamiziyi. Lishonta lyakuyi likulu halilaguwi kunkondu. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Panu wafalumi wawili awa hawalikali pamuhera pameza su waliyi, kumbiti kila yumu kamuholera myaguyi ukontola na kulipayira. Ila hapeni wafanikiwi, toziya shaka shashitulitwi shiweri shisoka ndiri. <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Lishonta lya mfalumi gwa Siliya haliwuyi muisi yakuyi pakawera na lunda ivuwa, kumbiti mfalumi hakajeri kuwaagamiziya wantu wa Mlungu. Hakatendi ntambu yakafira kwa wantu awa, shakapanu hakawuyi muisi yakuyi.<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />Mushaka yashipangitwi na Mlungu, hakayikangali isi ya Misri kwa mala imonga, kumbiti mwanjiru agu, mirandu hayiweri ntambu yingi. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Meli kulawa Kitimu yeni ndo Urumi hayimkomangi na yomberi hakaweri na lyoga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 11:30">Shakapanu hakawuyi pakawera na maya na hakawajegeri matabisiwu wantu yawaamini lipatanu lya Mlungu. Panu hakafati litakulu lya walii yawagalambukiti lipatanu lya Mlungu. <verse eid="DAN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />Wamashonta wakuwi hawayituli humba Numba ya Mlungu na maboma gakuyi, hawawatendi wantu waleki kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziwa kila lishaka na kugolosiya aku Numba ya Mlungu likalaliru lya lihalibisiya. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Hakawazyangizyangi walii yawawera ndiri waminika kwa Mlungu, kumbiti wantu walii yawawera waminika kwa Mlungu gwawu hawagoloki kwa ugangamala na kutenda matendu makulu. <verse eid="DAN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />Wantu waku yawana luhala muwamu mwa wantu hawawafundi wavuwa. Hangu, kwa mashaka madidini hawalaguwi kwa ligumba ama motu ama kuwatola lopola ama kupokwa lunda zawu. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Shaka wantu wa Mlungu pawaweriti mumatabisiwu, wantu wadidini tembera wamu wawu hawatendi hangu ila kwa uwaminikandiri. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Wamu wa wantu wa Mlungu yawana luhala hawalaguwi, su kuwatenda wamonga wapati kuwusiwa vidoda na kutakasiwa mpaka shaka sha upeleru, weni vinu hawenisoki.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />Nayomberi Mfalumi hakatendi ntambu yakafira. Hakalikwisi na kulitumba handa yomberi ndo mkulu kuliku wamlungu woseri na kumwigira Mlungu mkulu kuliku wamlungu woseri. Hakendereyi kuwera na mpatiru mpaka Mlungu pakamkomanga, ila mpaka galii gakatuliti Mlungu gasoki. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Mfalumi ayu hapeni kaweri na ligoya kwa wamlungu wa wazewi wakuyi pota Mlungu yulii yakafirwa na wadala. Hakawabeziyi wamlungu wamonga woseri, toziya hakalituli kuwera mkulu kuliku kila yumu gwawu. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />Pa wamlungu awa hakampanani mlungu mlolera gwa liboma, mweni wazewi wakuyi nakaka wamguwira ndiri, hakamlaviliri zahabu, feza na vintu vya beyi nkulu, na mafupu ga beyi nkulu. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />Hakaloleri maboma gakuyi kwa utanga wa mlungu gwa shihenga. Walii yawammana kuwera mfalumi hakawapanani ligoya likulu na hakawapanani ukulu na kuwabagulira litapaka gambira lifupu.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />Shaka sha upeleru mfalumi gwa Misri hakamkomangi mfalumi ayu gwa Siliya. Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Siliya hakankuli makomangu aga kwa makala handa liyega lya shivyulavyula, pakatendera mbutuka za kukwega na farasi, wakwena farasi na meli zivuwa. Hakazikangali isi zivuwa na kupita muisi azi handa malawa ga mashi. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />Hakayikangali ata isi ya Israeli su kuwalaga maelufu ga wantu. Kumbiti isi za Edomu na Mowabu na seemu nkulu ya Amoni, haziponi kulawa mumawoku mwakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Shaka pakazikangala isi azi, ata isi ya Misri hapeni iponeki. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />Hakaweri nazi hanja za zahabu, feza na vintu vya beyi nkulu vya isi ya Misri. Wantu wa Libiya na wantu wa Esiopiya hawaweri wantumintumi wakuyi. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Kumbiti visoweru kulawa kwagulawa mshenji na kushana havimtiriziyi. Na yomberi hakagoloki kwa nkalaliru na kwagamiziya wavuwa. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />Nentu ya aga, hakagolosiyi malingu gakuyi makulu pakati pa bahari na lugongu lwa Mlungu. Kumbiti hakahoweri pala na hapeni paweri na yoseri gwa kumtanga.<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s">Shaka sha upeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />Mushaka ashi Mikaeli mkulu gwa wantumintumi wa kumpindi, yakawera mlolera gwa wantu waku, hakalawili. Hakuweri na shaka sha ntabiku nentu kuliku vyaka vimonga vyoseri kwanjira maisi paganjiti kuwera pasipanu. Kumbiti, shaka ashi, kila yumu gwa wantu wa mweni litawu lyakuyi lilembwa mushitabu sha ukomu, hakalopolwi. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Wavuwa wa walii weni wahowiti kala, hawazyuki, wamonga hawapati ukomu wa mashaka goseri na wamonga hawapati soni na kubeziwa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Walii yawana luhala hawalangali gambira lyera yalilangala na walii yawawalongoziya wamonga kutenda yagafiruwa, hawalangali gambira ntondu mashaka goseri.<verse eid="DAN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />Vinu gwee Daniyeli, gutuli bada mirandu ayi, gushitawi shitabu na kushitula shimaniziwu mpaka shaka sha upeleru pashisoka. Wavuwa hawatugiri aku na aku na umani hawongeleki.<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Shakapanu, neni Daniyeli nola, mona wantu wawili wantuntumi wa kumpindi wagoloka muunenemu mwa lushemba, yumu uwega awu na yumonga uwega wa pili. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />“Yumu gwawu katakula na muntu ulii yakavaliti nguwu nfufu, yakaweriti panani pa mashi ga lushemba, hashi, hayiweri shaka gaa pamberi pa mirandu ayi ya kutiliziya hayenitimiyi?”<verse eid="DAN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ulii yakagolokiti uwega wa pampindi pamashi ga lushemba, kavala nguwu nvufu, kanyasula mawoku gakuyi goseri kugenda kumpindi. Shakapanu nimpikinira pakalirapa kwa litawu lya ulii yakalikala mashaka goseri pakalonga, haviweri vipindi viwili na nusu shipindi. Makakala ga wantu wan Mlungu pagapera, ndo mirandu yoseri ayi hayisoki.<verse eid="DAN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Mpikiniriti shakayoweriti, kumbiti nelewandiri. Su, nimkosiya, Mtuwa gwangu, ashilawili shishi pa goseri aga kupera?<verse eid="DAN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Muntu ulii kankula pakalonga, “Daniyeli vinu gugendi zaku, toziya visoweru avi ndo bada na vitatwa kwa kulekera shimaniziwu mpaka shaka sha upeleru.” <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />Wantu wavuwa hawalitakasiyi na kuwera kuherepa. “Kumbiti wantu wakontola hawendereyi kutenda makontola. Kwahera ata yumu gwawu gwa wakontola hakavimani, kumbiti yawana luhala hera ndo hawavimani.<verse eid="DAN 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />Kwanjira shaka shilii walekiti kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziwa kila lishaka, kulawa shaka shilii sha ngalaliru ya ihalibiya yaligolosiwitwi, hashiweri shaka sha mashaka elufu yimu miya mbili tisini. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Watekelelwa wantu walii yawahepelera mpaka mashaka galii elufu yimu miya tatu selasini na mhanu pagasoka.<verse eid="DAN 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />Kumbiti gwenga, Daniyeli, gwendeleyi kuwera mwanminika kwa Mlungu mpaka shaka shaku sha kuhowa, pagoseri aga kupera haguzyuki na kupata lifupu lyaku kulawa kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>